  START HERE! Register users with different roles and get their tokens.
  
  **Roles:**
  - `super_admin`: Full platform access, can create exercises
  - `gym_owner`: Can create/manage gyms and challenges
  - `client`: Can join gyms, participate in challenges, log workouts
